{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Mark 15:42-47 | Joseph Buries Jesus And The Women See The Tomb\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Mark 16:1-4 | The Women Come To Anoint Jesus And Find The Stone Moved\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Mark 16:5-7 | The Young Man Announces Jesus Has Risen\
